    "html": "<p>The radius of a planet is 4 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^6\"></span> m and the escape speed for the planet is 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^4\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the mass of the planet?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2 \\times 10^{14}}{G}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4 \\times 10^{14}}{G}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2 \\times 10^{22}}{G}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4 \\times 10^{22}}{G}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
